#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0665 expect=noViolation domain=DM
#note "FRESH -- the absent-column silence the twin never covers. AGE column is absent altogether. The rule's condition side is 'not empty(AGE)', and an absent column is an all-missing column, so the condition is false everywhere and the rule cannot fire. Asserts CG0665 does not double-report the sister rule CG0666's subject matter (AGEU populated with AGE missing)."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset DM label="Demographics"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col SUBJID  type=Char label="Subject Identifier for the Study"
col AGEU    type=Char label="Age Units"
---
CDISCPILOT01 | DM | 01-701-1015 | 1015 | YEARS
